{"3188510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project SEVER", "steam_appid": 3188510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/a0d384cb584cf872d7baf14eb2a573fe.poster.avif?t=1787566291\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/a0d384cb584cf872d7baf14eb2a573fe.webm?t=1787566291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/a0d384cb584cf872d7baf14eb2a573fe.mp4?t=1787566291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tempting offer: a short contract, generous compensation, and an expedition beyond the Arctic Circle. It was hard for you to turn down an offer like that. You were supposed to serve as a ship’s mechanic aboard the carrier vessel of a research submarine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > On one of the missions, you had to fill in for a sick mechanic who worked in the submarine crew, and as luck would have it, everything went wrong.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/7a45a4fea3245fb6318e86f453786456.poster.avif?t=1787566291\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/7a45a4fea3245fb6318e86f453786456.webm?t=1787566291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/7a45a4fea3245fb6318e86f453786456.mp4?t=1787566291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you’ll have to master the controls of the submarine to escape the gigantic trap formed by the ruins of an old Soviet underwater research complex that, at first glance, had seemed empty and completely abandoned. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Submarine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/91108db7aa92961a59cfc93f71c6c133.avif?t=1787566291\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras_big/91108db7aa92961a59cfc93f71c6c133.webp?t=1787566291 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The submarine of Project &quot;Sever&quot; was built using the most advanced technologies of its time. Decades later, its instruments carry a whiff of the past, yet their capabilities still command respect, just like the hull’s strength, engineered for enormous depths and designed to counter the gravest threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Sever&quot; has been created with exceptional care and attention to detail, featuring a multitude of interactive instruments and systems. Yet it remains surprisingly simple to operate, spend just a few minutes to learn the basics and you’ll be ready to set off on your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/3c2030c97d49819ebbdb2bb28491b150.poster.avif?t=1787566291\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/3c2030c97d49819ebbdb2bb28491b150.webm?t=1787566291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/3c2030c97d49819ebbdb2bb28491b150.mp4?t=1787566291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the holographic navigator to avoid getting lost in the labyrinths of the Zone, Sonar to perceive your surroundings, and the underwater drone to interact with the world outside the hull.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t forget to monitor energy consumption! The onboard nuclear reactor is prone to overheating.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Zone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/1e6057e3e30f9c913a965fc2c0dee9a3.poster.avif?t=1787566291\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/1e6057e3e30f9c913a965fc2c0dee9a3.webm?t=1787566291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/1e6057e3e30f9c913a965fc2c0dee9a3.mp4?t=1787566291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ruins of the colossal research complex built in the underwater depths within the anomalous zone. After an unknown catastrophe, the entire facility was abandoned decades ago. Meet the local inhabitants: autonomous drones and submarines, heavily armed security turrets, and countless gross creatures of the Incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mystery of past events by exploring the Zone and find a way to get out alive.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/a0d384cb584cf872d7baf14eb2a573fe.poster.avif?t=1787566291\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/a0d384cb584cf872d7baf14eb2a573fe.webm?t=1787566291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/a0d384cb584cf872d7baf14eb2a573fe.mp4?t=1787566291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tempting offer: a short contract, generous compensation, and an expedition beyond the Arctic Circle. It was hard for you to turn down an offer like that. You were supposed to serve as a ship’s mechanic aboard the carrier vessel of a research submarine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > On one of the missions, you had to fill in for a sick mechanic who worked in the submarine crew, and as luck would have it, everything went wrong.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/7a45a4fea3245fb6318e86f453786456.poster.avif?t=1787566291\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/7a45a4fea3245fb6318e86f453786456.webm?t=1787566291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/7a45a4fea3245fb6318e86f453786456.mp4?t=1787566291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you’ll have to master the controls of the submarine to escape the gigantic trap formed by the ruins of an old Soviet underwater research complex that, at first glance, had seemed empty and completely abandoned. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Submarine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/91108db7aa92961a59cfc93f71c6c133.avif?t=1787566291\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras_big/91108db7aa92961a59cfc93f71c6c133.webp?t=1787566291 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The submarine of Project &quot;Sever&quot; was built using the most advanced technologies of its time. Decades later, its instruments carry a whiff of the past, yet their capabilities still command respect, just like the hull’s strength, engineered for enormous depths and designed to counter the gravest threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Sever&quot; has been created with exceptional care and attention to detail, featuring a multitude of interactive instruments and systems. Yet it remains surprisingly simple to operate, spend just a few minutes to learn the basics and you’ll be ready to set off on your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/3c2030c97d49819ebbdb2bb28491b150.poster.avif?t=1787566291\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/3c2030c97d49819ebbdb2bb28491b150.webm?t=1787566291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/3c2030c97d49819ebbdb2bb28491b150.mp4?t=1787566291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the holographic navigator to avoid getting lost in the labyrinths of the Zone, Sonar to perceive your surroundings, and the underwater drone to interact with the world outside the hull.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t forget to monitor energy consumption! The onboard nuclear reactor is prone to overheating.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Zone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/1e6057e3e30f9c913a965fc2c0dee9a3.poster.avif?t=1787566291\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/1e6057e3e30f9c913a965fc2c0dee9a3.webm?t=1787566291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/extras/1e6057e3e30f9c913a965fc2c0dee9a3.mp4?t=1787566291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ruins of the colossal research complex built in the underwater depths within the anomalous zone. After an unknown catastrophe, the entire facility was abandoned decades ago. Meet the local inhabitants: autonomous drones and submarines, heavily armed security turrets, and countless gross creatures of the Incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the mystery of past events by exploring the Zone and find a way to get out alive.</p>", "short_description": "Project Sever is an adventure submarine simulator with a touch of horror. Master the controls of an old Project &quot;Sever&quot; submarine and learn to maintain it in working order to escape a deadly underwater trap and solve the mystery of the Anomalous Zone.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/header.jpg?t=1787566291", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/a20317b27567a7a7603d7a9a307bd8c493e5fa06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787566291", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3188510/a20317b27567a7a7603d7a9a307bd8c493e5fa06/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787566291", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<